<wpt lat="42.911007" lon="-122.146077"><ele>2171.0</ele><name>Rim Village</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:rim-village (OSM parking way/151972388); confidence: high; pdf_page: 311; book_elev_ft: 7000; quote: The caldera rim west of Rim Village at 7,000 feet is the most popular area to ski</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="42.934840" lon="-122.170200"><ele>2186.7</ele><name>Saddle between Discovery Point and The Watchman</name><desc>source: Point on West Rim Drive at the foot of The Watchman's south slope, between Discovery Point (OSM node/1796629353) and The Watchman (node/332610216), where the road leaves the 7,145-7,175 ft dip and starts its steady climb; DEM 7,175 ft vs the book's 7,172; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 311; book_elev_ft: 7172; quote: ski to the 7,172-foot saddle between Discovery Point and The Watchman, almost 3 miles from Rim Village</desc></wpt>
